    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d392">

                <pb facs="0629" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg559"/>

                <head>Mr. Romero to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Legation,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 15, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Romero presents his compliments to Mr. Seward, and has the honor of sending
                    to him, unofficially and confidentially, a copy of extracts of a letter dated
                    Paris, May 28th, 1867, addressed to Mr. Romero, to which he referred in the
                    conversation he had with Mr. Seward this afternoon at the Department of
                    State.</p>





